hots/contract-admin.json` and comparing them with `victual.openapi.json`.\n\n## Inherited schemas the stock routes embed\n\n| Schema | Undocumented keys the server sends |\n|---|---|\n| `Product` / `ProductWithoutUserfields` | `active`, `calories`, `cumulate_min_stock_amount_of_sub_products`, `default_best_before_days_after_freezing`, `default_best_before_days_after_thawing`, `default_purchase_price_type`, `default_stock_label_type`, `disable_open`, `due_type`, `hide_on_stock_overview`, `import_epoch`, `parent_product_id`, `qu_id_consume`, `qu_id_price`, `quick_consume_amount`, `quick_open_amount` |\n| `Location` | `active` and `is_freezer` are undocumented. `storage_class_id`, `tare_qu_id` and `tare_weight` are documented, but this route does not send them |\n| `QuantityUnit` | `active` |\n| `ProductBarcode` | `id`, `row_created_timestamp` |\n\n## Other\n\n- `ProductDetailsResponse.default_location` is documented but never sent; the code sends `location`.\n- `RecipeFulfillmentResponse` documents neither `product_names_comma_separated` (observed as `null`) nor `missing_products_count`.\n\n## Check\n\nAdd a `ContractTest` leg that fails when a recorded response key is not declared by its documented schema. Scope it to schemas that are fully documented, with no allowlist.\n","closed_by":{"login":"datagen24","id":20876965,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODc2OTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20876965?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24","html_url":"https://github.com/datagen24","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/orgs","repos_url":"http